    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Aron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuna ninche iishoritin e Aron o Musa teina kata pee eirorie Olaitoriani Musa to ldoinyo le Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.60"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 26.60",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kuna ninche nkarn oo layiok le Aron: Nadab olkikau, o Abihu, o Eleasar o Itamar; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuna ninche nkarn oo layiok le Aron, lelo apolosak ootubukokoki eilata aaput, laa ninche etegelua pee eisiaisho anaa lapolosak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.1+LEV.10.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 10.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.61"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 26.61",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake ore Nadab o Abihu netuata te dukuya Olaitoriani ina kata apa pee eishoru olasar le nkima nemesinya te dukuya Olaitoriani ti ong'ata e Sinai; nemeeta apa ninche nkera. Neaku Eliesa o Itamar apa ooisiaishote anaa lapolosak te nkata e nkishui e Aron papaai lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etegeluaki ile Lawi meisiaayia lapolosak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Olaitoriani ajoki Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Toriku olosho le Lawi ntinyiku, nipik ninche dukuya Aron ilo apolosani, pee etum ninche aaisiaayia ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo ninche eitabaya enkisiaayiare te ninye o to lturrur pooki te dukuya ilo ng'obor le ntumo, anaa enaisiaisho ninche ti atua olng'obor le Nkai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchoo ninche eitaisheiki imasaa pooki e ilo ng'obor le ntumo, nejing enkisiaayiare te nkaraki iltung'ana le Israel anaa te neisiaaisho ninche to lng'obor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninchooyo iyie ile Lawi aisho Aron o layiok lenyena; eishooki ninche ninye tukul ti atua iltung'ana le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigelu iyie Aron o layiok lenyena, nejing ninche esiai enye e mpolosare; kake te nelotu likae tung'ani anyiku neari metua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Olaitoriani ajoki Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ura, aitayu nanu ile Lawi aitung'uaa atua iltung'ana le Israel te rishata e pooki kikau too ltung'ana le Israel. Keaku ore ile Lawi naa ilaainei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " amu ore ilkikaunot pooki naa ilaainei; ore apa ina olong natara nanu metuata ilkikaunot pooki te nkop e Misiri, aitisinyaka nanu kewan ilkikaunot pooki tiatua Israel aa olayioni le tung'ani o le eng'ues; keaku ninche ilaainei: Ara nanu Olaitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikena oo le Lawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Olaitoriani ajoki Musa ti ong'ata e Sinai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nkena ilayiok le Lawi, anaa too nkajijik oo loo menye o too lmareita; ore pooki lee lo lapa obo neilep nkenai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eikena apa Musa ninche te risioroto o rorei lo Laitoriani, anaa enaitanapaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kulo apa ilayiok le Lawi anaa too nkarn enye: Gershon o Kohat o Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kuna ninche nkarn oo layiok le Gershon too lmareita lenye: Libni o Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Kohat anaa too lmareita lenye naa: Amram, o Ishar, o Hebron o Usiel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Merari anaa too lmareita lenye naa; Mahili o Mushi. Kulo ninche ilmareita loo lawi anaa too nkajijik oo loo menye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa ile Gershon naa olmarei le Libni o lmarei le Shimei; kulo apa ilmareita loo le Gershon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore esiana enye te risioroto e nkikena oo lewa pooki ebaiki olapa obo neilep naa nkalifuni naapishana o iip imiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilmareita loo le Gershon neun ilng'oborri ti oriong olng'obor le Nkai te nkalo o loo ntoluo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "te nebo Eliasaaf, olayioni le Lael aa ninye endukuya e nkaji oo loo menye too le Gershon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa enkitanapata oo layiok le Gershon te ilo ng'obor le ntumo, naa pee eing'or ilo ng'obor le Nkai, olng'obor kewan o enkimulumulata enye o enkikenet e kutuk aji e ilo ng'obor le ntumo o neeikishoreki to lgoriet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o enkikenet o lgoriet, ilo omanita olng'obor le Nkai o lperere lo lasar, o nkeenta enyena, o enkisiaayiare pooki naipirta kuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
